I've used {mu'inai} in the past because I interpret it as: mi nelci do <I'm
not motivated to do so by> lo nu do maljikca

It's a bit vaguer, but I think it still carries the meaning via implication=
.
 "I like you, but I'm not motivated to it because of your bad manners".

2010/10/20 Jorge Llamb=EDas <jjllambias@gmail.com>

